LiquidationPeriphery::constructor
├── when borrow token is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when usm registry is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when treasury is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when parameters are valid
    ├── it should set owner
    ├── it should set BORROW_TOKEN
    ├── it should set usmRegistry
    ├── it should set treasury
    ├── it should emit UsmRegistrySet
    └── it should emit TreasurySet
